      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_01",
      "hash64": "9A4E50C60C312BAA",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳看看，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n深缽的風車！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_02",
      "hash64": "9A4E4FC60C3129F7",
      "text": "它迎著吹過這帕底亞的風\\n緩慢且有力地旋轉著……[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_03",
      "hash64": "9A4E4EC60C312844",
      "text": "藉由我從那裡跳下來，\\n在道館挑戰者的眼前登場，\\r\\n能夠為對戰增添更多深度！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_select_01",
      "hash64": "84589E7D23A65B06",
      "text": "原來如此！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_select_02",
      "hash64": "84589D7D23A65953",
      "text": "是這樣啊……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_04",
      "hash64": "9A4E4DC60C312691",
      "text": "不愧是[VAR 0x0100(0000)]！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳懂我啊！哈～哈、哈、哈！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_05",
      "hash64": "9A4E4CC60C3124DE",
      "text": "這次我不需弄疼自己的腿，\\n也會生出最高傑作，因此就省下了！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_06",
      "hash64": "9A4E4BC60C31232B",
      "text": "我們兩個都是表演者，\\n無須多言了吧。[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_07",
      "hash64": "9A4E4AC60C312178",
      "text": "來，準備好了嗎！？\\n合作……開始！！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_08",
      "hash64": "9A4E49C60C311FC5",
      "text": "閣下在對戰中流水般地變換色彩，\\n繪出充滿獨創性的漸層！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_09",
      "hash64": "9A4E48C60C311E12",
      "text": "粗獷卻又柔和！\\n那難以言喻的對比，讓我甘拜下風了！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_10",
      "hash64": "9A4ACBC60C2E13D4",
      "text": "與閣下的對戰真是好……\\n能夠讓我回想起\\r\\n剛開始挑戰藝術時的初心。[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_11",
      "hash64": "9A4ACCC60C2E1587",
      "text": "對了，[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳身兼著代替首席冠軍\\n視察的任務，是吧。[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_12",
      "hash64": "9A4ACDC60C2E173A",
      "text": "哎，那份報告\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳就隨便看著辦吧。[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_13",
      "hash64": "9A4ACEC60C2E18ED",
      "text": "啊啊，靈感湧上來了。\\n止不住……止不住啊……！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_14",
      "hash64": "9A4AC7C60C2E0D08",
      "text": "我要去製作新作品了。\\n就此失陪！再會！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
